  "description": "The perfect man, Do-Yeong, appears in Se-Jin's lonely life. However, the happiness is short-lived, and Se-Jin becomes exhausted by Do-Yeong's gaslighting that crosses the line. At the moment when she finally decides to break up, she sees his psychotic side...Will Se-Jin be able to break up with Do-Yeong well?\n\n *\"You're the one who made me like this.\"* \n\nFrom now on, a woman's life-or-death breakup begins.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
